Bundled icons
=============

The adw-*-symbolic.svg icons come from libadwaita 1.10.0 (src/icons) and are
CC0-1.0.

The other icons come from adwaita-icon-theme 51.0
(https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme) and are used under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported license (CC-BY-SA-3.0),
one of the two licenses adwaita-icon-theme is offered under. They are
unmodified. Copyright: the GNOME Project.

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

switch-on-symbolic.svg and switch-off-symbolic.svg come from GTK 4.24.1's
built-in icons (gtk/icons), which GTK falls back to when a theme lacks them.
They are LGPL-2.1-or-later, the license of GTK and of AvaAdwaita.
